# #191 Jaina mirror: a second powershield hands the frost bolt back to its thrower
# a (Jaina) fires its neutral special at 600 from x -240; b (Jaina) at x 240 powershields it with
# one full trigger press. A reflection sends back a's own projectile: same family (a's fighter
# code), kind and model, half damage, turned around and owned by b (the `reflect` line on b's
# trace), and it strikes a, never b. Frames come from replaying this script's inputs through the
# match step from the quick-pair start; not yet run headless here (no /dev/uinput).
# Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick pair jaina proudmoore / jaina proudmoore
600 a tap X 2
637 b shield 1
667 b shield 0
# a powershields the returning projectile: it is a's again, still a's family, model and kind, at a quarter damage.
667 a shield 1
697 a shield 0
# View held a second: a moment the parity check replays.
727 a press VIEW
797 a release VIEW
#! expect b 638 reflect family 14 kind 5 model Abilities\Spells\Other\FrostBolt\FrostBoltMissile.mdx direction -1 multiplier 0.500 life 41
#! expect a 668 reflect family 14 kind 5 model Abilities\Spells\Other\FrostBolt\FrostBoltMissile.mdx direction 1 multiplier 0.250 life 11
#! absent a 600-668 damage
#! absent b 600-668 damage
